  "referenceNumber": "MYA0046",
  "remarks": "\nThe Myanmar Armed Forces have a track record of committing serious human rights violations and violations of international humanitarian law in Myanmar for decades.\nUral Avia LLC is a Russian company which has been responsible for the supply of parts and upkeep of aircraft for the Myanmar Armed Forces since the coup in February 2021. Therefore, Ural Avia LLC has been and is involved in the supply of restricted goods to Myanmar.\n",
